    "body": "Merged main through #470 (864a0fb8). **One behaviour to note:** in `stock_sim_carry::carry_turn`, main's #404 check (`one_machine`, `CARRY_MACHINE_CHANGE_REFUSAL`) and this PR's \"both ends must be mills\" overlap. The stricter #404 rule is kept, so a carry between two *different* mills, which this PR alone allowed, is now refused. #470's MCP tools now take a setup for the fixture table, and `set_setup_machine` reports the table of the machine it just set (new `fixture::table_of`). Both notes are in `docs/decisions/388-per-setup-mount.md`. Tests: setup_mounts_post, setup_mount, setup_carry, rest_across_setups, posting, mcp, mcp_setup and sim stock_carry pass; clippy is clean.",
